    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/abe70c5ffcb8427b913777a8b4792e47.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/abe70c5ffcb8427b913777a8b4792e47.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/abe70c5ffcb8427b913777a8b4792e47.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Command Center Earth, your job as pilot is to guide a missile through a series of increasingly difficult asteroid fields to intercept and destroy incoming meteors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/23a77bfd93c1280320ec08c9a1db0783.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/23a77bfd93c1280320ec08c9a1db0783.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/23a77bfd93c1280320ec08c9a1db0783.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Test your skills guiding the ISJ-10 though 25 unique and challenging levels. Be warned though, each level is more punishing than the last and it will take both precision, and determination in order to complete your mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/b84285fe93ea766fbac2326074eef176.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/b84285fe93ea766fbac2326074eef176.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/b84285fe93ea766fbac2326074eef176.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/e0f7d7cb2d4ca31627ae827ea9c0f6aa.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/e0f7d7cb2d4ca31627ae827ea9c0f6aa.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/e0f7d7cb2d4ca31627ae827ea9c0f6aa.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Operating the ISJ-10 might seem straightforward at first glance, but perfecting its movement is the real challenge. So buckle up and prepare to sharpen your skills - you will die a lot! But don't worry, the Command Center is well-stocked with missiles, making failure just a routine part of the business.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/b7d16a70ec6ab669b29c742874fa5164.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/b7d16a70ec6ab669b29c742874fa5164.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/b7d16a70ec6ab669b29c742874fa5164.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/624da7e285725db19d66b473693ea8ac.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/624da7e285725db19d66b473693ea8ac.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/624da7e285725db19d66b473693ea8ac.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Command Center Earth has been designed from the start to be easy to get into and easy to get out of. With zero loading screens the game seamlessly transitions from menus to action at the click of a button. Waiting for a few friends to join your lobby? Why not attempt to beat Yuma for the 25th time?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/ba52428757a70225f369ee7ac07ce52d.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/ba52428757a70225f369ee7ac07ce52d.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/ba52428757a70225f369ee7ac07ce52d.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/6653a4b966f12ed0a9096ed8352a1e99.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/6653a4b966f12ed0a9096ed8352a1e99.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/6653a4b966f12ed0a9096ed8352a1e99.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every level has been painstakingly crafted to ensure players can compete on a high stakes leaderboard. This starts with the fact that each level has been designed to be fully deterministic across machines! Find a small passage through a few meteors that no ones discovered? If your skills allow it, reap the benefits and shave off seconds off your leaderboard time!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/1ba98728eb723513cfa5abd9b3210d99.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/1ba98728eb723513cfa5abd9b3210d99.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/1ba98728eb723513cfa5abd9b3210d99.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/abe70c5ffcb8427b913777a8b4792e47.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/abe70c5ffcb8427b913777a8b4792e47.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/abe70c5ffcb8427b913777a8b4792e47.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Command Center Earth, your job as pilot is to guide a missile through a series of increasingly difficult asteroid fields to intercept and destroy incoming meteors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/23a77bfd93c1280320ec08c9a1db0783.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/23a77bfd93c1280320ec08c9a1db0783.webm?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/23a77bfd93c1280320ec08c9a1db0783.mp4?t=1746810937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Test your skills guiding the ISJ-10 though 25 unique and challenging levels. Be warned though, each level is more punishing than the last and it will take both precision, and determination in order to complete your mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639860/extras/b84285fe93ea766fbac2326074eef176.poster.avif?t=1746810937\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea